            "body": "Not 'mini.operators' since it provides operators and not Visual mode mappings. This is probably due to 'mini.ai' and it is a known state of things:\r\n- ['mini.ai' documentation](https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-ai.html#miniai.config-mappings).\r\n- #2338.\r\n- #2354.\r\n- #2386.",
